# Dev-server settings for `npm run dev`.
#
# VITE_DEV_BACKEND is the backend the Vite proxy forwards /v4, /v1,
# /service-info, /openapi.json, /seqcol, /ga4gh and /data_channel to.
# The default is the `refgenie dash` port. Uncomment and change it to develop
# against `refgenie serve` (server mode) instead.
#
# VITE_DEV_BACKEND=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# VITE_SERVICE_INFO_URL overrides where the SPA fetches its bootstrap config.
# VITE_API_BASE overrides the api_base returned by /service-info, and is the
# fallback API base when /service-info cannot be reached at all (the pure
# static-hosting case). Neither is needed for normal local development.
#
# VITE_SERVICE_INFO_URL=https://api.refgenie.org/service-info
# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.refgenie.org/v4
